{"id":"vod_sn_38479","vodId":"38479","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"露蒂的玩具","name_cn":"露蒂的玩具","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/889683f2393d162c7980ec7a7b10aa78.jpg"},"summary":"塔原直哉（佐藤利奈 配音）是一名单身父亲，独自抚养着女儿明日叶（田村由加莉 配音）。某日，直哉在求职的途中遇见了一名神秘女子，这位女子竟然施展魔法将直哉传送到了由梦魔族统治的尤各瓦尔兰王国中。　　露蒂（钉宫理惠 配音）是王国的公主，依靠吸收男性的精气维生，然而，童年的意外遭遇让露蒂对男性充满了厌恶，而直哉则成为了她的后宫，随时待命准备侍奉露蒂。起初，露蒂只是将直哉视作派遣无聊的玩具，然而，随着时间的推移，直哉的善良渐渐吸引了露蒂，露蒂的心中竟然生出了对于直哉的好感。让直哉没有想到的是，女儿明日叶亦被传送到了王国之中，露蒂就此交上了人生的第一个朋友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FBGW7yGUCV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xjKjz8TPj71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aABEBtmFj41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mcDBJtJ21w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/45ZwSsSuKm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x6Uk2nzzK21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FgUFiV2Yc91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0TvyrDdFRm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HksNpc8nKY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/132LwScxJf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0rugePZ1eY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xkGFtYu0qm1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.523Z"}